          {
            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the form below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div>Fearnley Sports Centre — Lifeguard Application Form</div><p>Personal details</p><ul><li>Name: Peter Smith</li><li>Home address: 130 South Main Street, Lake {{1}}</li><li>Contact number: {{2}} <em>(cell phone)</em></li></ul><p>Present occupation:</p><ul><li>has temporary job as a part-time {{3}}</li><li>is studying PE</li><li>wants to be a high school {{4}}</li></ul><p>Qualifications</p><ul><li>Already holds: water safety certificate</li><li>Certificate expires in: {{5}}</li></ul><p>Relevant work experience</p><ul><li>Lifeguard at: the {{6}}</li><li>Additional relevant skills: {{7}}</li></ul><p>Other information</p><p>Is happy to:</p><ul><li>coach in Fearnley</li><li>work on {{8}}</li><li>start at {{9}} o'clock mornings</li></ul><ul><li>How did the applicant find out about this job? On the {{10}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–16</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Arthur feels that when starting a business, mistakes should be",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "seen as an opportunity to learn."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "predicted and minimised."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "avoided at all costs."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Recent American studies found that confidence will",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "sometimes reduce people's chances of success."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "be increased by reading self-help books."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "ensure good results on business courses."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The American studies recommended that new entrepreneurs",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "listen to their colleagues' advice."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "get professional help when things go wrong."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "remain concentrated on their aims."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Arthur say about his own experience of marketing?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "He relied on what he already knew."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "He hired an expert to take care of it."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "He realised its importance too late."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Arthur think is an important quality shared by good leaders?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "They are ambitious for their company."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "They can deal with difficult people."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "They earn the respect of their workforce."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Arthur say about taking risks?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "He advises being cautious."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "He favours a long-term view."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "He believes it is financially advantageous."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-2",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 17 and 18</p>",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 17,
                "textHtml": "<strong>17 &amp; 18</strong> &nbsp;Which <strong>TWO</strong> things does Arthur say people should focus on when developing their business idea?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "making sure the idea is original"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "offering a better deal than competitors"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "being committed to it"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "D",
                    "textHtml": "paying attention to detail"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "E",
                    "textHtml": "fixing realistic prices"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-3",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 19 and 20</p>",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 19,
                "textHtml": "<strong>19 &amp; 20</strong> &nbsp;Which <strong>TWO</strong> things does Arthur say helped him get his business started?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "family support"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "getting a loan from a bank"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "good business advice"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "D",
                    "textHtml": "a favourable economic climate"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "E",
                    "textHtml": "an effective approach to business"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
